# VideoFlow - Project Context & Access Guide

## Quick Access Commands

### VPS (OVH - Ubuntu)
- **SSH:** `ssh vps-clean` (Host: 51.91.158.233, User: ubuntu, Key: ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_new)
- **PM2 services:**
  - `image-worker` — Node.js polling worker for image/thumbnail/prompt generation
  - `video-render-service` — Video rendering
  - `video-storage-api` — Video storage API (port 3001)
  - `webhook-deploy` — Auto-deploy on git push
- **Project path on VPS:** `~/purple`
- **Deploy frontend:** `ssh vps-clean "cd ~/purple && git pull origin main && sudo ./deploy.sh"`
- **Deploy image-worker:** `ssh vps-clean "cd ~/purple && git pull origin main && cd image-worker && pm2 restart image-worker"`
- **View worker logs:** `ssh vps-clean "pm2 logs image-worker --lines 50"`
- **Docker frontend:** Container `videoflow` on port 127.0.0.1:8080, nginx reverse proxy to HTTPS

